{"action": "shared_understanding_confirmed", "at": "2026-09-25T18:09:16+00:00", "data": {"summary": "Commerce persists Manage Stock after create through one private catalog-items/set-manage-stock action. Enabling writes managed setup-required and increments manageStockRevision without auto-running Configure Inventory. Disabling writes unmanaged with no Inventory mutation, leaves manual availability, backorders, and store binding untouched, and releases reconstructable registration claims so re-enable can reconcile fresh. Configure Inventory persist re-reads and refuses to resurrect a changed or unmanaged catalog row. Proof is FEATURE_MAP plus bin/verify-commerce types, unit, and SQLite/D1 contract tests. Excluded: visual EmDash UI, template-store catch-up, live Inventory transport, cart/checkout/orders, payments, npm publish, and EmDash pin changes."}, "event_id": "69219b85-1b64-4591-9ead-a9e607b6eeef"}
